From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quill <siinspam@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 21:41:20 +0000
Subject: feat(nako): plugins written for upstream names load unmodified

The rebrand renames the core packages, their helpers and the environment
variables, so every plugin written for upstream failed at its first core
import. Serve the upstream module names as the real modules, resolve
upstream-spelled attributes on them, and read an upstream-spelled
environment variable from its renamed one. A build that kept the
upstream name is unaffected.

Co-authored-by: Nako <nako@quill.moe>

